{"seq":3,"slug":"cell-metabolism-homeostasis","title":"细胞代谢与稳态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/energy-metabolism/cell-metabolism-homeostasis","wordCount":1806,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"细胞代谢与稳态\">细胞代谢与稳态</h1><p>前两篇拆解了两个产能引擎的内部齿轮。但细胞从不在真空中匀速运转——进食与饥饿交替、剧烈运动与静息切换、温度与酸度起伏。本篇不再重复任何一条具体通路的推导，而是退后一步看全局：成千上万个反应如何被酶组织成网络、如何被反馈精确调速、又如何在外界剧烈波动时维持内部的恒定。这是把分散的生化过程整合为「活的细胞」的关键视角。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代谢是细胞内全部化学反应的总和，分两个方向：分解代谢把大分子拆成小分子并释放能量（如呼吸），合成代谢消耗能量构建大分子（如蛋白质合成）。二者通过 ATP 与 NAD(P)H 这类共享货币耦合——分解代谢产出的能量货币被合成代谢消费。稳态则是细胞在外界扰动下维持内部理化条件（能量水平、pH、离子浓度、氧化还原态）相对恒定的能力，靠负反馈调控实现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[营养输入] --&gt; B[分解代谢&lt;br/&gt;产ATP NADH]&#10;  B --&gt; C[ATP/AMP比值]&#10;  C --&gt; D{能量感应}&#10;  D --&gt;|能量低 AMPK| E[开分解 关合成]&#10;  D --&gt;|能量高营养足 mTOR| F[开合成 长大增殖]&#10;  B --&gt; G[合成代谢&lt;br/&gt;耗能建大分子]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  C --&gt; H[负反馈维持稳态]\">graph TD\n  A[营养输入] --&gt; B[分解代谢&lt;br/&gt;产ATP NADH]\n  B --&gt; C[ATP/AMP比值]\n  C --&gt; D{能量感应}\n  D --&gt;|能量低 AMPK| E[开分解 关合成]\n  D --&gt;|能量高营养足 mTOR| F[开合成 长大增殖]\n  B --&gt; G[合成代谢&lt;br/&gt;耗能建大分子]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  C --&gt; H[负反馈维持稳态]</pre><p>代谢调控发生在多个时间尺度，对照如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调控层次</th>\n<th>起效速度</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>别构调节</td>\n<td>毫秒–秒</td>\n<td>代谢物结合改变酶构象</td>\n<td>ATP 抑制 PFK-1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共价修饰</td>\n<td>秒–分</td>\n<td>磷酸化等可逆修饰</td>\n<td>AMPK 磷酸化下游酶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区室化</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>反应分隔在不同细胞器</td>\n<td>糖酵解在胞质、TCA 在基质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基因表达</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>转录翻译水平改变酶量</td>\n<td>饥饿诱导脂肪酸氧化酶</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"酶动力学-调速的物理基础\">酶动力学：调速的物理基础</h2><p>代谢之所以可调，根源在于反应几乎都由酶催化，而酶活性可被精细控制。米氏方程描述了底物浓度与反应速率的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\frac{V_{\\max}\\,[S]}{K_m + [S]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是饱和时的最大速率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（米氏常数）是反应速率达到一半 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时的底物浓度，反映酶对底物的亲和力——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越小，亲和力越高。这条双曲线意味着：在底物匮乏区，速率近似与底物浓度成正比，细胞因而能用底物供给本身来调节通量。</p>\n<p>抑制剂可改变这两个参数：竞争性抑制剂升高表观 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而不改 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，非竞争性抑制剂降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。许多药物正是通过这些机制靶向特定代谢酶。酶的催化效率还使一些反应得以在温和的体温下进行，否则在体外需高温高压——这是细胞维持有序的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈调控-通路如何自我配速\">反馈调控：通路如何自我配速</h2><p>代谢网络靠反馈避免浪费与失衡。最经典的是终产物反馈抑制：一条合成通路的终产物会别构抑制该通路上游的限速酶，从而在产物充足时自动关闭生产。糖酵解的 PFK-1 受 ATP 抑制、受 AMP 激活，就是能量状态对产能通路的反馈（其细节见 <a href=\"mitochondria-respiration\">线粒体与细胞呼吸</a>）。</p>\n<p>这种设计让细胞像一套自动恒温系统：无需中央指挥，每条通路据自身产物与能量货币的浓度自我调速。别构调节起效极快（毫秒级），适合应对瞬时波动；而当扰动持续，细胞会动用更慢但更深远的手段——共价修饰与基因表达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能量感应-ampk-与-mtor-的对峙\">能量感应：AMPK 与 mTOR 的对峙</h2><p>细胞用两个核心传感器读取自身的「能量与营养状态」，并据此在「省」与「长」之间切换。AMPK（AMP 激活蛋白激酶）是「燃料警报器」：当 ATP 被大量消耗、AMP/ATP 比值升高时它被激活，于是开启产能的分解代谢（如脂肪酸氧化、葡萄糖摄取）、关闭耗能的合成代谢，并促进线粒体新生。</p>\n<p>mTOR（雷帕霉素机械靶标）则相反，是「生长开关」：当营养（氨基酸）与生长信号充足时它被激活，推动蛋白质合成、细胞生长与增殖，同时抑制自噬这一回收程序。AMPK 与 mTOR 互相拮抗，共同把细胞行为锚定在能量供需的现实上。mTOR 抑制自噬、AMPK 促进自噬的这条轴，是连接代谢与细胞自我清除的关键，详见 <a href=\"../fate-frontiers/apoptosis-and-autophagy\">细胞凋亡与自噬</a>。这些感应器接收的上游信号，又来自更广义的信号转导网络（见 <a href=\"../information-regulation/cell-signaling\">细胞信号转导</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离子-ph-与氧化还原稳态\">离子、pH 与氧化还原稳态</h2><p>除能量外，细胞还须把内部理化环境钉在狭窄区间。离子稳态依赖膜上的泵与通道：钠钾泵维持胞内高钾低钠、钙泵把胞质游离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ca^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压到极低水平（使钙能作为灵敏的信号），这些运输机制的原理见 <a href=\"../cell-fundamentals/membranes-and-transport\">生物膜与膜运输</a>。pH 稳态靠碳酸氢盐等缓冲体系与质子泵，把胞质 pH 稳在约 7.2，因为酶活性对 pH 极为敏感。</p>\n<p>氧化还原稳态尤为微妙。呼吸链不可避免地泄漏电子、产生活性氧（ROS）。适量 ROS 是信号分子，过量则损伤脂质、蛋白与 DNA。细胞用谷胱甘肽、超氧化物歧化酶、过氧化氢酶等抗氧化系统维持平衡。一旦失衡（氧化应激），会触发损伤应答乃至程序性死亡——包括以脂质过氧化为特征的铁死亡，相关内容见 <a href=\"../fate-frontiers/apoptosis-and-autophagy\">细胞凋亡与自噬</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代谢的可塑性与疾病\">代谢的可塑性与疾病</h2><p>代谢网络高度可塑，能随需求重排通量。一个经典例子是增殖细胞（尤其癌细胞）即便有氧也偏好糖酵解产能并大量摄取葡萄糖，即「瓦尔堡效应」——牺牲产能效率换取快速供应合成代谢所需的碳骨架。这说明代谢不只为产能，也为「造材料」服务，且与细胞的增殖决策深度耦合（增殖机制见 <a href=\"../information-regulation/cell-cycle-and-division\">细胞周期与分裂</a>）。</p>\n<p>代谢失调是众多疾病的核心：糖尿病是葡萄糖稳态崩溃，肥胖是能量收支失衡，许多神经退行病伴随线粒体功能与氧化还原失衡。正因如此，AMPK、mTOR 等代谢枢纽成为药物研发的热门靶点。理解了细胞如何供能与维稳，下一章将转向它如何感知与决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代谢分分解（产能）与合成（耗能），经 ATP/NAD(P)H 货币耦合；稳态靠负反馈维持能量、pH、离子、氧化还原恒定。</li>\n<li>酶动力学（米氏方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = V_{\\max}[S]/(K_m+[S])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span>）是调速的物理基础，抑制剂通过改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 起作用。</li>\n<li>反馈抑制让每条通路据产物与能量货币自我配速；调控跨别构、共价修饰、区室化、基因表达多个时间尺度。</li>\n<li>AMPK（省）与 mTOR（长）互相拮抗，把细胞行为锚定在能量营养状态上，并与自噬、信号、增殖相连。</li>\n<li>离子/pH/氧化还原稳态依赖泵、缓冲与抗氧化系统；代谢可塑性（如瓦尔堡效应）及其失调是众多疾病的核心。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"细胞代谢与稳态","id":"细胞代谢与稳态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"酶动力学：调速的物理基础","id":"酶动力学-调速的物理基础"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈调控：通路如何自我配速","id":"反馈调控-通路如何自我配速"},{"level":2,"text":"能量感应：AMPK 与 mTOR 的对峙","id":"能量感应-ampk-与-mtor-的对峙"},{"level":2,"text":"离子、pH 与氧化还原稳态","id":"离子-ph-与氧化还原稳态"},{"level":2,"text":"代谢的可塑性与疾病","id":"代谢的可塑性与疾病"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"叶绿体与光合作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/energy-metabolism/chloroplast-photosynthesis"},"next":{"title":"细胞信号转导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/information-regulation/cell-signaling"}}